id: healer
name: Healer
order: 4
optionOf: spirit-of-namek
optionEffect: 4
description: >
  Increase the amount of Life Points regained from your use of Healing Hands by your Surgency. Additionally, if you use Healing Hands on a Studied Ally, they may either: regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of the Life Points they gained, OR stop suffering from a Combat Condition (except Suffocating).
text: >
  Healer [Triggered]: Increase the amount of Life Points regained from your use of Healing Hands by your Surgency. Additionally, if you use Healing Hands on a Studied Ally, they may either: regain Ki Points equal to 1/2 of the Life Points they gained, OR stop suffering from a Combat Condition (except Suffocating).

---

# Your Surgency on every Healing Hands; a Studied Ally healed asked which of the two (use-maneuver.mjs askHeal, chat.mjs
# healerChoice).
[passive]
allow refined.healer;
